---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<SiteLayout title="Selected Work | Ansh Nandwani" description="Selected work in cross-channel media products, campaign pacing and marketing measurement." path="/work">
  <section class="page-hero container"><h1>Build the product. Improve the decision.</h1><p>Selected outcomes from cross-channel planning, campaign performance and marketing measurement. Client and employer details are kept private.</p></section>
  <section class="section-tight container">
    <article class="work-feature"><div class="work-feature-copy"><h2>CAD $30M in first-year revenue.</h2><p>A cross-channel planning and measurement product brought media planning and performance into one commercial offer.</p><ul><li>Connected advertiser planning and measurement needs.</li><li>Helped shape a product teams could take to market.</li><li>The product generated CAD $30 million in its first year.</li></ul></div><div class="work-visual" role="img" aria-label="A connected sequence from planning to measurement"><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-dot">TV</div></div></article>
  </section>
  <section class="section container">
    <article class="work-feature"><div class="work-feature-copy"><h2>120%+ lift in ad fill rate.</h2><p>Custom campaign pacing curves helped improve how available advertising inventory was filled.</p><ul><li>Identified pacing as a practical performance opportunity.</li><li>Developed custom curves using first-party and ad-serving signals.</li><li>Worked with Google and ad-serving partners to put the changes into practice.</li></ul></div><div class="work-visual" role="img" aria-label="Campaign pacing connecting signals to ad inventory"><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-dot">+120%</div></div></article>
  </section>
  <section class="section container">
    <article class="work-feature"><div class="work-feature-copy"><h2>A near-real-time view of media and sales.</h2><p>A media performance dashboard brought advertising, point-of-sale and store-visit data together to support campaign planning and attribution.</p><ul><li>Connected media delivery with sales and store-visit signals.</li><li>Built the reporting view in Google Data Studio.</li><li>Made it easier to compare campaign activity with real-world outcomes.</li></ul></div><div class="work-visual" role="img" aria-label="Media, sales and store-visit signals brought into one reporting view"><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-orbit"></div><div class="work-dot">↗</div></div></article>
  </section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="cta-panel"><h2>What would a useful result look like for your team?</h2><p>Bring a goal, a bottleneck or an early idea. We can start with a focused assessment.</p><a class="button button-primary book-link" href="/contact#booking" data-track="book_call_click">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
